        <h2 class="sc-card__title">Web search</h2>
        <p class="sc-card__copy">
            Lets API-key models search the web for current information (<span class="sc-mono">web.search</span>) through Brave Search.
            The key is stored in the protected vault and never shown to the agent.
            <a href="@SwarmCodeWebSearch.KeyUrl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get a Brave Search API key</a>.
