    <section class="sc-card">
        <h2 class="sc-card__title">Fallback model search</h2>
        <p class="sc-card__copy">When a provider is unavailable, search configured catalogs for alternatives within these limits. Your model choice determines where to start. When a model declines, enabled hand-offs prefer your less restricted fallback models. All attempts count toward Max lanes per request.</p>
        <label class="sc-toggle">
            <input id="sc-discovery-enabled" type="checkbox" @bind="_fallbackDiscovery.Enabled" />
            <span class="sc-toggle__track"></span><span>Find alternative models when a provider is unavailable</span>
